   "preuve": "NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities FY2026 = 167 M$ (FY2025 : 1 531 M$) ; PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets FY2026 = 379 M$. Source : XBRL company facts, kpis-haut/FDXF.json (calcul FCF = OCF - capex)."
